        {
          "fact": "F4",
          "source": "lem-a-closed-smooth-manifold-has-the-homotopy-type-of-a-finite-cw-complex",
          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "Assume the Axiom of Choice ([[def-axiom-of-choice]]). Let $M$ be a closed smooth\nmanifold ([[def-smooth-manifold]]). Then $M$ has the homotopy type of a finite\nCW complex ([[def-cw-complex-with-closure-finiteness-and-weak-topology]]).",
