          "fact": "F1",
          "source": "lem-integral-intersection-pairing-is-unimodular",
          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "Assume the Axiom of Choice. Let $X$ be a closed connected oriented smooth four-manifold with $\\pi_1(X)=0$. Its integral intersection lattice on $H_2(X;\\mathbb Z)/\\operatorname{Tor}$ is a finite-rank free abelian group and its intersection pairing is unimodular.",
          "uses": [
