          "quote": "Assume the Axiom of Choice. Let $K\\subset S^3$ be a smooth oriented knot such that its double branched cover $M=\\Sigma_2(K)$ is a rational homology sphere. Let $D\\subset B^4$ be a smooth proper embedded disk with boundary $K$, and let $B_D$ be the connected double cover of $B^4$ branched over $D$. Let $W$ be a compact connected smooth simply connected oriented four-manifold with boundary identified orientation-compatibly with $M$, and assume its boundary intersection form is positive definite. Assume also that the image of $\\pi_1(M)\\to\\pi_1(B_D)$ normally generates $\\pi_1(B_D)$, meaning its normal closure is the whole group. Then the oriented gluing $X=W\\cup_M(-B_D)$ is a closed smooth simply connected positive-definite four-manifold, and inclusion induces an isometric full-rank embedding $Q_W\\hookrightarrow Q_X$ of integral intersection lattices with $b_2(X)=b_2(W)$.",
