          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "Assume full AC. Let $X$ be a closed connected smooth simply connected oriented four-manifold. If its integral intersection form is positive definite, then there is an integral basis of $H_2(X;\\mathbb Z)/\\operatorname{Tor}$ in which the form is the identity matrix. Equivalently, the integral intersection lattice is isometric to the standard diagonal lattice $\\mathbb Z^{b_2(X)}$ with dot product.",
          "uses": [
