          "fact": "F2",
          "source": "lem-signed-essential-product-annulus-decomposition",
          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "Let a balanced sutured manifold have connected positive and negative boundary faces. An essential separating product-annulus decomposition into balanced pieces admits a graded integral tensor chain equivalence, with coherent orientation classes induced from the specified class. This realizes the homology tensor formula over every field and the integral Künneth formula with Tor. Product-disk decompositions and product one-handle additions have literal integral complex identifications. The closure construction for any connected pair of faces identifies its top knot complex with the actual sutured disk complex using the specified marking and orientation class.",
          "uses": [
            "1.1",
