          "claim": "Put $\\alpha_{ij}=d\\log(z_i-z_j)$. Since $z_i-z_j$ is nonzero on $\\operatorname{Conf}_q(\\mathbb C)$, in local coordinates $\\alpha_{ij}=d(z_i-z_j)/(z_i-z_j)$ and $d\\alpha_{ij}=0$ by equality of mixed partial derivatives. Thus $d\\Omega_q=0$.",
