          "claim": "Write $a=t_{ij}$, $b=t_{kl}$ for two distinct chord generators. In the expansion of $\\Omega_q\\wedge\\Omega_q$, the two ordered terms for these generators combine as $[a,b]\\alpha_{ij}\\wedge\\alpha_{kl}$. If the pairs have four distinct indices, $[a,b]=0$ by [F1]; if they are the same pair, $\\alpha_{ij}\\wedge\\alpha_{ij}=0$. Hence only pairs of generators supported on a common triple of strands can contribute.",
