          "claim": "Send the w-regions and z-regions of the given surface to the two colors $U,V$. The source ring is now exactly $\\mathbb F_2[U,V]$ and its variable-power filtration is exactly the specified two-coordinate filtration. The curvature vanishes by the two-color identity. Hence [F1] applies to the actual maps of [F3] as genuine filtered equivariant chain maps, not merely as hat homology maps or uncolored counts.",
          "step": "1.1",
          "inputs": [
