          "id": "step-1-3",
          "claim": "Apply [F2] to the actual gluing and the two specified structures $\\mathfrak s_1,\\mathfrak s_2$. Restriction of each summand to the two pieces is exactly the condition displayed in the Statement; no unmarked or total-Spin-c map has replaced these maps. The two-color specialization respects the composition and homotopies, giving the displayed formula over $\\mathbb F_2[U,V]$.",
          "step": "1.3",
          "inputs": [
