          "quote": "Let $(E_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}$ be an increasing sequence of measurable sets for a measure $\\mu$, so $E_n\\subseteq E_{n+1}$. Then\n\n$$\\mu\\left(\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}E_n\\right)=\\sup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mu(E_n).$$\n\nNo finiteness hypothesis is required.",
