          "fact": "F9",
          "source": "prop-retracts-inject-fundamental-groups",
          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "Let $A\\subseteq X$, let $i:A\\hookrightarrow X$ be the inclusion, and choose $a\\in A$. If $A$ is a retract of $X$ ([[def-retraction-and-deformation-retract]]), then\n\n$$i_*:\\pi_1(A,a)\\longrightarrow\\pi_1(X,a)$$\n\nis injective. If $A$ is a deformation retract of $X$, the inclusion and retraction induce mutually inverse fundamental-group isomorphisms at every basepoint of $A$.",
