          "source": "lem-every-oriented-link-admits-a-regular-projection",
          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "Assume $\\mathrm{AC}_\\omega$. For every oriented link $L$ contained in\n$\\mathbb R^3$, the directions $u\\in S^2$ for which the orthogonal projection\n$\\pi_u$ is regular are dense in $S^2$. Every such projection has finitely\nmany double points.",
