          "source": "lem-knot-exterior-h1-is-generated-by-meridian",
          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "Let $K\\subset S^3$ be a smooth oriented knot with a chosen closed product\ntubular neighborhood $N(K)$, exterior $E_K=S^3\\setminus\\operatorname{int}N(K)$,\nand positive meridian $\\mu_K$. Then\n$$H_1(E_K;\\mathbb Z)=\\mathbb Z[\\mu_K].$$\nThe assertion uses integral singular homology and the stated tube convention.",
