          "source": "lem-boundary-compressible-annulus-is-boundary-parallel",
          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "Let $M$ be a compact connected orientable irreducible $3$-manifold whose boundary components are tori. Let $A\\subset M$ be a connected properly embedded incompressible annulus with $\\partial A\\subset\\partial M$. If $A$ is boundary-compressible, then $A$ is boundary-parallel.",
