          "source": "lem-knot-group-infinity-collar",
          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "Let $K\\subset\\mathbb R^3$ be a compact smooth knot and let $b\\in\\mathbb R^3\\setminus K$. The inclusion $\\mathbb R^3\\setminus K\\hookrightarrow S^3\\setminus K$ induces an isomorphism\n$$\\pi_1(\\mathbb R^3\\setminus K,b)\\xrightarrow{\\ \\cong\\ }\\pi_1(S^3\\setminus K,b).$$",
          "uses": [
