          "claim": "Let $E_\\Lambda=\\operatorname{span}\\{e_j:\\lambda_j\\le\\Lambda\\}$. For $u\\in E_\\Lambda$, step 4.1 gives $\\|u\\|_{H^1}^2\\le(1+\\Lambda)\\|u\\|_2^2$. If $\\dim E_\\Lambda$ exceeded the rank of $P_N\\mathcal G|_{E_\\Lambda}$, rank-nullity would give nonzero $u\\in E_\\Lambda$ with $P_N\\mathcal Gu=0$. Since $\\mathcal L\\mathcal G=I$ and $\\mathcal L$ is bounded, step 1.1 then gives $\\|u\\|_2\\le C(1+N)^{-1}\\|u\\|_{H^1}\\le C\\sqrt{1+\\Lambda}(1+N)^{-1}\\|u\\|_2$. Choose $N\\ge2C\\sqrt{1+\\Lambda}$ to contradict $u\\ne0$. Thus $N_M(\\Lambda)=\\dim E_\\Lambda\\le\\operatorname{rank}(P_N\\mathcal G)\\le J(2N+1)^n\\le C'(1+\\Lambda)^{n/2}$.",
