          "source": "def-smooth-collar-of-a-manifold-boundary",
          "source_section": "Definition",
          "quote": "A smooth collar is a smooth embedding $c:\\partial M\\times[0,\\varepsilon)\\to M$ such that $c(p,0)=p$ and whose image is an open neighbourhood of $\\partial M$ in $M$. Locally one may first use a positive smooth width depending on $p$.",
          "uses": [
